# Burst feedback of an R0 satellite (galaxy 1) under its central (galaxy 0): reheated = 2.9 *
# stars and ejected = 0.5 * stars for stars = 0.1 * ColdGas (plausible values).
# galaxy 0: R0 reference model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256 6d859a3a2ea422e3...) Snap_32 row 0, GalaxyIndex 0,
# Type 0
# galaxy 1: R0 reference model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256 6d859a3a2ea422e3...) Snap_32 row 1, GalaxyIndex 28,
# Type 1
# End-of-snapshot output values used as plausible call inputs, not reconstructed call-time state;
# OutflowRate is the output converted back to code units times deltaT; the histories are zero, as
# at substep 0 after SAGE26's first-occupied reset (R/src/core_build_model.c:278-281).
